title: Budget Scene
subtitle: A new year
on-arrival:  resources_transfer = resources; {!
// see post_event.scene.dry for changes.
Q.economic_growth += 1;
!}
tags: event

For the coming year, [+ year +], we expect to have a budget of <span class="double-underline">[+ total_income +] resouces</span>.

+[+ dues +] from our membership dues.

+[+ income_lo +] from LO due to our [+ lo_relations : lo_relations+]

+[+ income_state +] from the state, due to the results of the last election.

- @what_expenses: How should we spend these?

@what_expenses

At the end of last year we had a total of [+ total_expenses +] resources of expenditure[? if income_other > 0 : , partly funded by extraordinary incomes?].:

Apparatus: -[+ expense_apparatus +]

Local chapters: -[+ expense_local_chapters +]

Newspapers: -[+ expense_newspaper +]

Youth party: -[+ expense_dsu +]

This left us with [+ resources_transfer +] unused resources that we bring over to the new year.

If we were to not change anything, we would be left with <span class="double-underline">[+ resources + resources_transfer +] resources in surplus</span>


- @more_newspaper: Our press should have more funding.
- @more_administration: Our apparatus should see more funding.
- @more_youth_party: Our youth party should see more funding.
- @more_local_chapters: Our local chapters could use more funding.
- @less_newspaper: The press can survive a cut.
- @less_administration: Our apparatus has grown too big.
- @less_youth_party: Our youth party could survive a cut.
- @less_local_chapters: Our local chapters has to survive on less.
- @dont_change_b: lets keep the budget unchanged.


@more_newspaper
on-arrival: {!
Q.expense_newspaper += 1;
!}

= **[+ year +] Budget**

Dues: +[+ dues +]

LO: +[+ income_lo +]

State: +[+ income_state +]

[? if income_other > 0 : Other: + [+ income_other +] ?]

<span class="double-underline">Total income: [+ total_income +]</span>

Apparatus: -[+ expense_apparatus +]

Local chapters: -[+ expense_local_chapters +]

Newspapers: -[+ expense_newspaper +]

Youth party: -[+ expense_dsu +]

<span class="double-underline">Total expenses: [+ total_expenses +]</span>

<span class="double-underline">Surplus resources: [+ resources +]</span>

We will allocate one additional resource to the party newspapers.

- @more_newspaper: Our press should have more funding.
- @more_administration: Our apparatus should see more funding.
- @more_youth_party: Our youth party should see more funding.
- @more_local_chapters: Our local chapters could use more funding.
- @less_newspaper: The press can survive a cut.
- @less_administration: Our apparatus has grown too big.
